Resolve zombie session issue when Delete Session Response arrives
after ENB-S1 context removal during TAU bearer status mismatch.

Changes:
- Add deletion_in_progress flag to track sessions being deleted
- Allow session cleanup for OGS_GTP_DELETE_NO_ACTION even when enb_ue is NULL
- Skip deletion_in_progress sessions in TAU Accept construction
- Skip deletion_in_progress sessions in mme_sess_find_by_apn()
- Improve bearer removal to clean up bearer_to_modify_list
- Add comprehensive documentation (Japanese and English)

Implements 3GPP TS 24.301 Section 5.5.3.2.4 local deactivation.

